Walking in always put a smile on my face because they go all out posters and banners and standees. That's Chancellor Haynes again, who used to drive to the grand from his job across town. This place was everything his theater wasn't. It was brand new. The seats had new car smell. There were arcade games, neon, everything, multiple concession stands, enormous displays and props, and then there were the auditoriums themselves, 24 of them. The screens were massive.
走进去总是让我脸上露出笑容，因为他们全力以赴，海报、横幅和立牌应有尽有。那是钱塞勒·汉兹，他过去常从城另一头的工作地点开车去Grand影院。这个地方拥有他原来工作的电影院所没有的一切。它是全新的。座位上有新车的味道。有街机游戏、霓虹灯、一切，多个特许经营摊位，巨大的展示和道具，还有放映厅本身，足足有24个。屏幕非常巨大。

