Even the smaller theaters had bigger screens than the theaters that I was used to. Tinsler wasn't the only person going out of their way to get to this theater. I know there were six of us that went six guys. We all piled into like an 84 Thunderbird. I can remember that more than 20 years later, Kevin Morris still remembers the first time he went to the AMC Grand 24. It was a well over an hour drive. Was it worth it? Oh, yeah. Well, for me, it was because I actually got a seat. It was packed.
即使是较小的放映厅，屏幕也比我习惯的电影院要大。钱塞勒并不是唯一一个不远万里来到这家电影院的人。我知道我们有六个人去了，六个家伙。我们都挤进了一辆84年的雷鸟（Thunderbird）。我记得那件事，20多年后，凯文·莫里斯（Kevin Morris）仍然记得他第一次去AMC Grand 24的情景。那是一段超过一小时的车程。值得吗？哦，是的。对我来说，因为我真的抢到了座位。那里挤满了人。

